# Build output.
bin/
obj/
*.user

# The publish tree and the packaged installers.
#
# Artifacts are deliberately NOT committed. A self-contained MSI is ~57 MB and GitHub refuses any
# blob over 100 MB outright, so a repository that carried every iteration's installer would stop
# accepting pushes within a few builds. Releases go to the private registry at admin.capital-iz.com,
# which is where the in-app updater looks for them; git carries the source that produces them.
Windows/build/
Windows/artifacts/

# Claude Code worktrees and session state. These are checkouts of a different repository that happen
# to sit inside this folder; sweeping them into a commit is how another agent's in-flight work gets
# committed by mistake.
.claude/

# Local scratch.
*.tmp
*.log
